WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.929 --> 00:00:22.180
Today on Journey to the Microcosmos, we're
going to be doing something a little bit different.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:28.710
See, here at Microcosmos headquarters we've
been putting in a lot of nights and weekends

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:33.950
to make sure you have an upload every Monday,
or occasionally Tuesday.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:39.620
And while somedays are for learning, other
days might be better spent just looking.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:45.590
And thus, so we can get a little bit ahead
and maybe be a little less stressed, and also

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:52.980
so you can, if you want, just chill with some
of our favorite tiny beasts, today's episode

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.600
is going to be just music and video.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:04.960
Basically, here are some really cool little
organisms, and I'm just going to go.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.880
Bye!

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:05.189
Thank you for coming on this journey with
us, as we explore the unseen world that surrounds us.

00:05:05.189 --> 00:05:11.500
As always, if you want see more from our Master
of Microscopes, James, check out Jam and Germs

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:12.500
